    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decurion is a top-down score attack shooter with short and focused levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Clear the level, defend your base, score high, don't die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to achieve higher scores: chaining kills, using melee, clearing levels quickly, and staying alive as long as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is then spendable between levels. After each level, use it to buy upgrades that will help you survive what\u2019s next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/ff5eea28f8c021fbd46d35ab255f13a4.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/ff5eea28f8c021fbd46d35ab255f13a4.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/ff5eea28f8c021fbd46d35ab255f13a4.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mech and Pilot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each mech and pilot has a unique ability that you can combine. There are 3 mechs and 3 pilots in the game. Every mech can be combined with every pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/2a15940932cd36cca95e104899c19fb9.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/2a15940932cd36cca95e104899c19fb9.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/2a15940932cd36cca95e104899c19fb9.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will help you through the battle. Various upgrades range from getting extra health to freezing or blowing up all enemies on the level at once. Enemies have their own power-ups that they can use against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/1615e6ea10303494ea6783da36645d1a.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/1615e6ea10303494ea6783da36645d1a.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/1615e6ea10303494ea6783da36645d1a.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are events that occur during the level and change the situation on the field. For example, they may restructure level geometry or temporarily slow down everyone. So even if you've already played the level you still have to adapt and rethink your play on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/d96cc664cb22bad123ab1cbc51b8f0c7.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/d96cc664cb22bad123ab1cbc51b8f0c7.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/d96cc664cb22bad123ab1cbc51b8f0c7.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the level environment to hide, flank/gank enemies. It also serves as protection for the base. But the environment can and will eventually be destroyed during the level. Every level is thus constantly changing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Shot, One Kill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything and anyone goes down with one shot. You, enemies, or your base. Be precise, don't be an easy target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Co-Op </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in couch co-op. Help each other, compete with each other, invent new strategies. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decurion is a top-down score attack shooter with short and focused levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Clear the level, defend your base, score high, don't die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to achieve higher scores: chaining kills, using melee, clearing levels quickly, and staying alive as long as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is then spendable between levels. After each level, use it to buy upgrades that will help you survive what\u2019s next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/ff5eea28f8c021fbd46d35ab255f13a4.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/ff5eea28f8c021fbd46d35ab255f13a4.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/ff5eea28f8c021fbd46d35ab255f13a4.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mech and Pilot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each mech and pilot has a unique ability that you can combine. There are 3 mechs and 3 pilots in the game. Every mech can be combined with every pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/2a15940932cd36cca95e104899c19fb9.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/2a15940932cd36cca95e104899c19fb9.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/2a15940932cd36cca95e104899c19fb9.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will help you through the battle. Various upgrades range from getting extra health to freezing or blowing up all enemies on the level at once. Enemies have their own power-ups that they can use against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/1615e6ea10303494ea6783da36645d1a.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/1615e6ea10303494ea6783da36645d1a.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/1615e6ea10303494ea6783da36645d1a.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are events that occur during the level and change the situation on the field. For example, they may restructure level geometry or temporarily slow down everyone. So even if you've already played the level you still have to adapt and rethink your play on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/d96cc664cb22bad123ab1cbc51b8f0c7.poster.avif?t=1754814277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/d96cc664cb22bad123ab1cbc51b8f0c7.webm?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/extras/d96cc664cb22bad123ab1cbc51b8f0c7.mp4?t=1754814277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the level environment to hide, flank/gank enemies. It also serves as protection for the base. But the environment can and will eventually be destroyed during the level. Every level is thus constantly changing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Shot, One Kill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything and anyone goes down with one shot. You, enemies, or your base. Be precise, don't be an easy target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Co-Op </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in couch co-op. Help each other, compete with each other, invent new strategies. </p>",
    "short_description": "A one-shot, one-kill top-down shooter where you have to find balance between the base defense and pushing forward for high scores. Learn how to use the destructible level environment to your advantage, adapt to anomalies, get good. Play solo or in couch co-op.",
